    "Hardware proximity metadata is needed before settings can be saved. Move the pen out of range and back in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等待 proximity 硬件元数据后才能保存持久配置。请让笔离开再进入感应范围。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hardware proximity metadata is needed before settings can be saved. Move the pen out of range and back in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IDs are reported by the system or driver; zero may be a placeholder. Model groups cannot distinguish pens without unique IDs. Silence does not mean disconnection. Up to 32 identities are retained.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标识为系统 / 驱动报告值，0 可能是占位。同型号归组无法区分缺少唯一标识的多支笔；无事件不代表断开。最多保留 32 个身份。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "IDs are reported by the system or driver; zero may be a placeholder. Model groups cannot distinguish pens without unique IDs. Silence does not mean disconnection. Up to 32 identities are retained."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identity matching": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身份匹配"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identity matching"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If PenActor is missing, click + and add /Applications/PenActor.app. Relaunch if requested. Local testing does not require Input Monitoring.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若列表中没有 PenActor，请点 + 添加 /Applications/PenActor.app。授权后按系统提示重新打开应用；窗口内测试无需输入监控权限。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If PenActor is missing, click + and add /Applications/PenActor.app. Relaunch if requested. Local testing does not require Input Monitoring."
